WEBVTT

00:04.670 --> 00:07.170
Did you hear, Tamaki?

00:07.170 --> 00:08.300
About the spiriting away?

00:09.270 --> 00:10.640
Spiriting away?

00:10.640 --> 00:11.260
Yeah.

00:13.680 --> 00:16.610
It happened again yesterday, here in the village.

00:20.920 --> 00:23.410
It hasn't happened in a long time.

00:39.800 --> 00:41.540
Spirited away?

00:41.540 --> 00:42.740
On the edge of town?

00:42.740 --> 00:44.510
Really?

00:44.510 --> 00:46.000
No way!

00:48.010 --> 00:49.180
Again?

00:49.180 --> 00:51.700
It certainly hasn't been peaceful.

02:32.010 --> 02:35.640
I've come today with a request.

02:36.320 --> 02:38.690
This is about the offering, isn't it?

02:38.150 --> 02:40.920
Ominous

02:38.150 --> 02:40.920
Dark Clouds

02:39.120 --> 02:40.920
Just as I would expect from you, Lady Baba.

02:41.060 --> 02:44.650
You can easily see what I am thinking.

02:48.230 --> 02:50.030
Then I beg of you,

02:50.030 --> 02:52.500
please do not perform the ceremonial offering.

02:52.830 --> 02:55.100
I cannot grant that request.

02:55.600 --> 02:58.100
You should already know.

02:58.810 --> 03:03.270
The Onikirimaru was not completely sealed.

03:04.650 --> 03:07.450
That cannot be set free to this world.

03:07.450 --> 03:09.470
We have no other choice.

03:09.980 --> 03:13.520
The guardians are the protectors of the Tamayori princess,

03:13.520 --> 03:16.290
the sealer of the Onikirimaru.

03:16.290 --> 03:20.560
You haven't forgotten this, have you?

03:21.400 --> 03:22.630
Always fixating on the fact

03:22.630 --> 03:26.530
that your mother became the ceremonial offering,

03:26.530 --> 03:28.800
and you call yourself a guardian?

03:31.710 --> 03:34.180
There is nothing left to discuss.

03:35.310 --> 03:36.410
Mitsuru?

03:36.410 --> 03:37.310
Yes.

04:05.910 --> 04:07.140
<i>That day,</i>

04:07.440 --> 04:09.410
<i>Tamaki's strength...</i>

04:09.910 --> 04:12.810
<i>far surpassed Lady Baba's.</i>

04:16.950 --> 04:19.510
<i>So why hasn't the Onikirimaru...?</i>

04:20.520 --> 04:24.190
<i>But maybe if we had the Artifacts...</i>

04:26.190 --> 04:27.160
<i>However...</i>

04:28.760 --> 04:31.360
Please do not perform the ceremonial offering.

04:32.300 --> 04:34.700
We have no other choice.

04:37.740 --> 04:41.010
I've come to offer myself to the gods.

04:42.480 --> 04:44.170
Mother?

04:46.110 --> 04:50.110
<i>I cannot allow the ceremonial offering to happen.</i>

04:52.150 --> 04:56.180
<i>I'll use any means necessary to stop it.</i>

04:57.630 --> 05:01.760
<i>Even if that means I will fail as a guardian.</i>

05:02.660 --> 05:04.600
Man, I'm hungry.

05:04.600 --> 05:06.800
Before we look into the spiriting away,

05:06.800 --> 05:10.100
let's have Mitsuru make us something to eat.

05:10.100 --> 05:11.570
Sounds good.

05:12.640 --> 05:17.080
Mitsuru's cooking is so good.
It really energizes you.

05:18.610 --> 05:21.050
Her inarizushi flavoring is exquisite.

05:21.650 --> 05:23.450
Oh, Ohmi.

05:23.820 --> 05:25.750
Welcome home, everyone.

05:27.290 --> 05:28.860
Where's Inukai?

05:28.860 --> 05:31.880
Huh? He was here until a second ago.

05:32.130 --> 05:34.490
Where'd he go?

05:43.500 --> 05:44.970
You're...

05:55.680 --> 05:57.920
You stink today as well.

05:57.920 --> 06:00.150
The smell of a traitor.

06:01.860 --> 06:03.590
What's your problem?

06:16.570 --> 06:17.600
<i>It's not like...</i>

06:25.010 --> 06:27.850
<i>It's not like I'm a traitor because I wanted to be one.</i>

06:29.880 --> 06:31.110
We cannot use him.

06:31.550 --> 06:32.590
He has no strength.

06:32.590 --> 06:37.890
<i>I was only seven at the time, and I didn't and still don't know what happened.</i>

06:37.890 --> 06:41.990
<i>No, what didn't happen.</i>

06:43.700 --> 06:46.170
<i>I was abandoned by my parents and by Kifu village.</i>

06:47.340 --> 06:49.240
<i>I had lost my home and I was alone.</i>

06:50.710 --> 06:53.200
<i>I was taken in by a strange temple.</i>

06:55.280 --> 06:56.640
<i>That's why I...</i>

07:02.680 --> 07:05.790
Mother? Father? Where are you?

07:05.790 --> 07:07.390
I want to go home!

07:07.390 --> 07:09.880
I want to go back to Kifu village!

07:27.380 --> 07:28.740
Form the contract.

07:29.280 --> 07:30.580
Who's there?

07:30.950 --> 07:33.150
My name is Logos.

07:33.150 --> 07:35.280
I am an agent of Sephiroth.

07:35.780 --> 07:38.720
If you devote yourself to that name,

07:38.720 --> 07:40.590
I will give you duty.

07:42.560 --> 07:47.400
Eight years from now, a holy woman will appear here.

07:47.400 --> 07:49.460
You will help this woman.

07:50.100 --> 07:54.000
If you do, she will give you a home.

07:54.000 --> 07:57.270
You will be free of all your pain.

07:57.640 --> 07:58.940
A holy woman?

07:59.310 --> 08:01.470
Form the contract, Funf.

08:01.940 --> 08:04.070
Repeat after me.

08:07.480 --> 08:11.020
I devote my name to Sephiroth.

08:11.020 --> 08:14.460
My name is no longer mine.

08:15.020 --> 08:18.420
I am no longer myself.

08:19.760 --> 08:23.600
I devote my name to Sephiroth.

08:28.200 --> 08:29.470
What?

08:31.340 --> 08:32.600
You're...

08:33.610 --> 08:36.100
the homeless Funf?

08:40.310 --> 08:43.250
<i>I've always searched for a home,</i>

08:44.150 --> 08:46.480
<i>a place where I'm not alone.</i>

08:48.660 --> 08:50.890
<i>That's why I...</i>

08:57.570 --> 08:59.630
Show yourself, Monado!

09:00.000 --> 09:01.260
Monado Aria!

09:07.710 --> 09:09.200
What shall you do?

09:09.710 --> 09:12.200
I will not involve him.

09:12.580 --> 09:15.520
You should still be able to go.

09:17.050 --> 09:18.080
Yes.

09:19.250 --> 09:22.060
Monado Aria, I must speak with you!

09:22.060 --> 09:23.150
Monado Aria!

09:24.930 --> 09:26.660
Don't be so noisy.

09:26.660 --> 09:27.900
Vier.

09:27.900 --> 09:29.730
Please let me see Monado Aria.

09:29.730 --> 09:31.290
I want to talk to her!

09:32.530 --> 09:35.000
The contract is finished.

09:35.470 --> 09:39.240
So Monado Aria will never see you again.

09:39.240 --> 09:42.640
Not yet. It isn't completely finished!

09:42.640 --> 09:44.250
The Onikirimaru seal isn't-

09:44.250 --> 09:45.270
Listen.

09:46.450 --> 09:51.420
Monado Aria has specifically told me that she doesn't wish

09:51.420 --> 09:53.650
to meet with you again.

09:54.060 --> 09:57.860
And that she will not allow you to set foot in these woods again.

09:58.160 --> 10:00.990
Because Logos is divided internally?

10:01.260 --> 10:02.420
You should go.

10:02.860 --> 10:04.300
Go home.

10:06.570 --> 10:08.000
Wait.

10:15.810 --> 10:17.210
According to the contract,

10:18.450 --> 10:21.480
that which you want, in other words,

10:21.480 --> 10:26.280
a place to call home and to be free of your pain.

10:27.320 --> 10:29.790
What do you plan to do?

10:29.790 --> 10:32.590
I will return you to your birthplace.

10:34.000 --> 10:35.590
To Kifu village?

10:36.930 --> 10:40.930
Awaken the sleeping power inside you.

10:44.240 --> 10:46.770
<i>The holy woman who appeared eight years later</i>

10:46.770 --> 10:50.400
<i>gave me a chance to return to the place I wanted to be.</i>

10:51.810 --> 10:56.150
<i>That's why I told Aria about the barrier and the Artifacts.</i>

10:56.620 --> 11:00.610
<i>But my true desire is still...</i>

11:01.460 --> 11:04.650
Please, let me meet with
Monado Aria once more!

11:10.460 --> 11:11.490
Ohmi...

11:17.440 --> 11:19.300
Ohmi...

11:25.110 --> 11:27.140
I heard everything.

11:27.880 --> 11:30.890
I had been suspicious of your movements from the start,

11:30.890 --> 11:34.450
and I thought if I followed you,
I might end up here.

11:34.890 --> 11:37.420
So you were the traitor.

11:38.760 --> 11:40.660
Listen to me, Ohmi.

11:40.660 --> 11:46.100
I did this because I thought this was best, for the village and for everyone.

11:46.800 --> 11:48.770
If only the Onikirimaru didn't exist.

11:49.500 --> 11:50.990
Because something like that exists...

11:51.870 --> 11:55.780
That's why I wanted Logos to take away the Onikirimaru.

11:56.080 --> 11:59.340
Then I'm sure that everyone could be happy.

11:59.680 --> 12:01.510
That's why I...

12:02.050 --> 12:05.380
You betrayed your friends and put them in danger.

12:06.520 --> 12:08.490
No! It's not like that!

12:08.720 --> 12:13.560
Inukai. You're being conceited.

12:14.360 --> 12:15.730
Ohmi...

12:15.730 --> 12:17.870
You can call me what you want.

12:17.870 --> 12:21.900
But until Logos takes away the Onikirimaru,

12:21.900 --> 12:24.070
please don't tell anyone about this.

12:24.070 --> 12:26.340
I never had any intention of telling anyone.

12:27.580 --> 12:29.480
What do you mean?

12:29.480 --> 12:32.810
I've become genuinely sick of it myself.

12:33.450 --> 12:37.910
To continue sacrificing many for the sake of that seal...

12:38.290 --> 12:39.840
The very idea...

12:41.720 --> 12:43.620
The ceremonial offering.

12:43.620 --> 12:45.220
The blood seal.

12:45.560 --> 12:49.330
How many villagers have been sacrificed?

12:49.900 --> 12:52.530
This must not continue.

12:53.530 --> 12:54.400
Ohmi.

12:55.400 --> 12:57.470
To stop the bloody cycle,

12:57.470 --> 13:00.100
we have no choice but to give the Onikirimaru to Logos.

13:00.940 --> 13:02.930
That's the conclusion I came to.

13:04.650 --> 13:06.010
You're there, aren't you?

13:06.010 --> 13:08.380
Why don't you come out?

13:19.430 --> 13:21.690
As I would expect from the guardians' leader.

13:22.260 --> 13:23.130
You!

13:23.130 --> 13:27.000
But is what you said true?

13:27.000 --> 13:30.960
Yes, let's tip the scale on this battle immediately.

13:32.340 --> 13:34.740
For that purpose, let me join Logos.

13:37.010 --> 13:40.070
You have no qualms with betraying your comrades?

13:42.320 --> 13:43.680
You can't.

13:43.680 --> 13:45.740
You can't become a traitor, too, Ohmi!

13:46.250 --> 13:48.120
Are you saying that the grudge born

13:48.120 --> 13:50.610
from the murder of your mother is that deep?

13:53.330 --> 13:54.530
Either way...

13:54.530 --> 13:55.500
You can't!

13:57.830 --> 14:00.060
Don't get in my way.

14:03.040 --> 14:04.770
Well, fine.

14:04.770 --> 14:07.210
If you didn't really mean it,

14:07.210 --> 14:09.110
we'll just have to deal with you appropriately.

14:10.680 --> 14:11.650
Ohmi.

14:17.790 --> 14:19.520
What?!

14:19.890 --> 14:22.290
It's a lie. Tell me it's a lie!

14:22.290 --> 14:23.920
Stop it, Senpai!

14:24.530 --> 14:26.150
Please calm down!

14:27.530 --> 14:30.460
Try to remember again, Shinji.

14:31.030 --> 14:33.000
Wasn't it some kind of mistake?

14:33.500 --> 14:36.670
I don't want to believe it either.

14:36.670 --> 14:40.540
But Ohmi himself said distinctly that he would join Logos.

14:40.710 --> 14:42.510
I can't...

14:41.540 --> 14:42.510
...believe that!

14:42.510 --> 14:44.030
It's not a lie!

14:48.980 --> 14:50.110
I also...

14:51.150 --> 14:55.220
don't think that Suguru could do such a thing.

14:55.220 --> 14:58.620
But I cannot believe that
Shinji would lie, either.

14:59.660 --> 15:00.690
But either way,

15:00.690 --> 15:04.190
I don't think this is the time for fighting.

15:04.430 --> 15:06.230
We don't know why he did this,

15:06.230 --> 15:09.070
but if there's still time, we have to stop Suguru!

15:09.940 --> 15:11.200
You're right.

15:12.240 --> 15:17.180
Ohmi wouldn't betray us for no reason.

15:17.610 --> 15:19.550
There must be something.

15:20.550 --> 15:21.450
Yes.

15:21.450 --> 15:23.120
All right. Let's go!

15:23.120 --> 15:25.050
Shinji, please lead us.

15:25.950 --> 15:27.180
Yes.

15:30.190 --> 15:33.460
This is the place.
I was here with Ohmi.

15:33.460 --> 15:35.160
Look at the fog.

15:35.700 --> 15:38.060
Logos is somewhere in these woods?

15:38.400 --> 15:39.330
Yes.

15:40.570 --> 15:42.700
Damn. Which way?

15:43.440 --> 15:45.700
Ohmi! Where are you?!

15:46.810 --> 15:48.070
Suguru!

15:49.280 --> 15:51.540
Your friends have arrived.

15:52.210 --> 15:55.380
What a beautiful display of friendship.

15:56.080 --> 16:00.380
However, they will never make it here.

16:01.720 --> 16:07.530
Whether they'll even make it back home alive is questionable.

16:20.470 --> 16:21.240
Are you okay?

16:21.240 --> 16:22.710
Y-Yeah.

16:28.520 --> 16:29.820
Suguru!

16:29.820 --> 16:31.080
Ohmi!

16:36.460 --> 16:38.160
Suguru?

16:38.160 --> 16:39.150
Go home.

16:41.000 --> 16:45.830
I am no longer your guardian nor your comrade.

16:46.800 --> 16:51.510
If you do not leave, we will fight.

16:51.510 --> 16:54.300
Though this is not what I... no.

16:59.450 --> 17:01.850
What Logos wants.

17:11.890 --> 17:13.590
Let's go home for today.

17:14.530 --> 17:16.000
Stop messing around.

17:16.000 --> 17:17.530
As if we could go home now!

17:17.530 --> 17:19.520
At least explain, Ohmi!

17:20.100 --> 17:21.840
Why is this happening?

17:21.840 --> 17:23.570
Ohmi is serious.

17:23.570 --> 17:25.770
You can all tell that, too.

17:25.770 --> 17:26.740
But...

17:26.740 --> 17:28.640
Do you want to put Tamaki in danger?

17:33.310 --> 17:34.470
Damn it.

17:38.750 --> 17:41.320
It seems as though you understand.

17:41.320 --> 17:44.020
Then take care on your way home.

17:55.240 --> 17:56.530
Suguru!

18:35.240 --> 18:38.370
Why have you allowed him to join Logos?

18:39.480 --> 18:41.350
I don't trust him.

18:42.820 --> 18:46.720
I do not trust him either.

18:48.990 --> 18:51.330
But both your enemies and your friends

18:51.330 --> 18:54.630
are easier to use when they're within your reach.

18:59.170 --> 19:02.230
Damn. What should we do now?

19:02.800 --> 19:05.470
What does Ohmi want us to do?

19:06.810 --> 19:08.140
I'll trust him.

19:09.340 --> 19:11.370
I'll trust Suguru.

19:12.510 --> 19:16.110
I don't know why this happened.

19:17.480 --> 19:19.040
But I'll trust him.

19:19.490 --> 19:22.750
Right now all I can do is trust him.

19:23.890 --> 19:26.550
We're friends, aren't we?

19:27.360 --> 19:30.090
No... we've become friends.

19:32.070 --> 19:34.400
We went though lots of hard times.

19:35.040 --> 19:36.160
You're right.

19:37.440 --> 19:41.180
And we were born and raised as guardians,

19:41.180 --> 19:43.010
which binds us together.

19:43.840 --> 19:48.010
I cannot believe that Ohmi would leave us without a reason.

19:53.650 --> 19:58.680
Until now, and from now on, we are the five guardians.

20:15.380 --> 20:17.870
Is something wrong, Inukai?

20:18.480 --> 20:19.710
Sorry.

20:21.850 --> 20:24.010
Will you give me some time alone?

20:38.670 --> 20:40.460
Mitsuru?

20:43.940 --> 20:47.670
U-Uh, um... I...

21:13.900 --> 21:16.030
<i>Look at those rain clouds...</i>

23:18.860 --> 23:19.920
Man...

23:20.460 --> 23:22.950
This might turn out to be a real storm.

23:39.610 --> 23:43.210
If you're in pain, it's all right to cry.

23:45.390 --> 23:49.380
You don't need to carry it all by yourself.

23:50.790 --> 23:54.060
I'll help you bear it.

23:56.060 --> 24:01.000
Next time: The Traitor's Vow
